he extra 475 bucks to have the other two teeth pulled. So it was worth the 26.99 dollers i paid for it for the first month and i think i am gonna renew it next month too.<P>------------------<BR>84 fiero 2m4 <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
